# App install (Play Store only)

Never prompt Chrome, Edge, or Safari to “Install app” / **Add to Home Screen**. That creates a second, often stale PWA next to the Play Store app.

## Binding rules

- Install CTAs go to the **current store listing** in `frontend/src/utils/storeLinks.js` (`PLAY_STORE_URL`). Do not hardcode old version codes or APK/AAB files.
- Block `beforeinstallprompt` (`preventDefault`) so the browser cannot install a web copy.
- Web manifest must keep `prefer_related_applications: true` + Play `related_applications`.
- iOS: `APP_STORE_URL` when live, otherwise App Store search for Luminexa. Never Add to Home Screen.
- Play Store always serves the latest published track — do not deep-link a specific version.

## Do not “simplify”

- Do not call `beforeinstallprompt.prompt()`.
- Do not recommend PWA / TWA-from-browser as the install path.
